     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525955.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525946.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525925.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525964.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525945.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525928.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525948.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525968.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525935.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215525934.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532412.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532496.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532475.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532415.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532495.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532478.gif" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" alt="" hspace=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201609/2016092215532405.jpg" onload=resizepic(this) border=0><BR><BR></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=3>为继承中华民族优秀传统习俗，弘扬中华民族优秀传统文化，着力引导广大学生群众认知传统、尊重传统、弘扬传统，增强爱国爱乡热情，提高文明素质，加强班团建设，我校团委积极号召全校各个团支部就《开展“我们的节日·中秋节”主题活动实施方案》文件精神，围绕“团圆、团结、丰收”主题，组织开展“我们的节日&#8226;中秋”系列活动。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、“做一件小事”<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=3>社会文明氛围的形成需要点滴凝聚，文明城市的创建需要我们每个人的力量。“勿以善小而不为”，在中秋假期中，同学们将口号化为行动，身体力行，开展“清洁家园”活动，打扫社区、街道卫生，清洁环境，美化庭院，用干净整洁美丽的环境面貌欢度中秋。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>9</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">日下午，高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班同学在下午二时许打扫社区、街道卫生，清洁环境，美化庭院的“清洁家园”活动。他们来到了燕甸园社区、罗门社区等地打扫卫生，用干净整洁的环境面貌欢度中秋。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班、高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学们也纷纷拿起工具，志愿清扫社区，为清洁家园贡献力量。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学们在中秋佳节期间，走上街头，做起来公交小督导，做到了文明有礼出行，安全快乐过节。他们还走进社区，开展“清洁家园”活动，一个个干劲十足！</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">二、“送一份温暖”</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=3>中秋期间，我校各团支部还积极开展慈善爱心活动，慰问帮扶孤寡老人、残疾人、特困家庭、困难老党员、老模范以及节日期间坚守工作岗位的人员；关爱留守儿童、进城务工人员子女、空巢老人、农民工，给他们送去社会的关爱和节日的温暖。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班同学组成小队利用中秋小长假，向市民赠送中秋月饼，给他们送去社会的关爱和节日的温暖。下图是小队成员傅伊岚向沿街市民赠送中秋月饼。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班文军宝，薛政辉，赵珏，邵明珠，黄舒婕，陈诤，陈宗乐，冯旻等十多人到达了绍兴老年康复中心，送上中秋礼物和问候。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">在暑假，高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班同学已成功举行了第一季“矮寨中学图书捐赠活动”，并获得了矮寨中学龙伟校长和一中校长朱雯的表扬。因此，借中秋节这一契机，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">班开展了“矮寨中学图书捐赠活动”第二季活动，虽然时间很紧张，但同学们依然积极奉献出自己的一份爱心，纷纷捐出图书。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">中秋，是家家团聚的日子，但是福利院里的孩子们此刻却显得尤为孤单。出于他们的关心和爱，高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学决定为孩子们准备一些礼物，让他们度过一个快乐的中秋。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>9</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>18</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">日下午，同学们带着自己准备的礼物从学校出发来到福利院。对同学们而言，这是一个不一样的、更有爱意的中秋；希望对孩子们而言也是如此。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学们为孤寡老人送去了饼干，帮助她穿针线</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">，询问了老奶奶的身体状况和生活情况，做她的聆听者，希望她保持乐观心态：虽然没有家人的陪伴，但依然感受到那份暖意。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">高二（<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">班的李康融，何仲文同学在中秋之日结伴在十字路口，马路边搀扶老人过马路，活动后，他们说道：“天虽阴雨，但听着老人的感谢，心里还是暖烘烘的！”</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的邱竞冬同学冒着大雨去探望了绍诸高速收费站的工作人员，活动后，她写道：“中秋佳节，一个团圆的日子，当许多人赶回家与亲人相聚时，高速公路的收费员仍坚守在自己的岗位上，并且更加忙碌。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN></FONT><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">三、“说一句祝福”</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=3>同学们积极开展并参与中秋主题诗词美文、名片佳作赏析、手机短信传箴言、微信中秋点赞等活动，通过网络，制作模拟月饼、中秋贺卡，向亲朋好友、道德模范、身边好人等发送感言寄语，送上一份浓浓的祝福，分享欢度传统佳节的喜悦。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班同学通过手写和网络，制作中秋贺卡，向亲朋好友送上一份祝福。小队成员王莹、贺晨尔等同学书写贺卡赠送班级同学。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">让温暖、文明、文化不止停留在我们口头的言论，书本的名词，让其践行到生活中的一点一滴，给这个节日增加一些温暖的色调，需要你的参与。高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班金建树，徐钰童等多名同学制作了中秋贺卡。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的老师和同学们借助“中秋”这个中国传统节日，举办了中秋节特别活动。他们首先了解了中秋节的由来、中秋节的习俗，接着大家即兴朗诵有关中秋节的诗词，演讲中秋月饼的故事，最后怀着感恩的心为父母、为老师、为同学、为朋友</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>......</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">送上美好的节日祝福！</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班、高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班、高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班、高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>13</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班等班级的同学们在中秋之际还纷纷通过电话、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>QQ</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">、微信等送上了中秋祝福。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学写下了对道德模范的感言寄语。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">时光杳如黄鹤</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">中秋悄然降临</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">虽说十五的月亮十六圆</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">而你们的道德精神却总是如期而至</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">温暖如冬阳</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">激扬如柴炬</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">感谢一路上有你们</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">让人类匿藏心灵深处的美德曝于日晒</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>,</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">在光亮中寻得共鸣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>!</FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt" align=right><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>                                                  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>(8)</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">班</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">许亦雯</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt" align=right><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>     </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">中秋佳节，皓月当空。看到那一轮明月，从古到今，永恒地照耀着这片大地。看着这片大地上，人们悲欢离合。千年前，大禹三过家门而不入，他的妻儿曾在明月下默默期许百年。无独有偶，苏轼曾发出“但愿人长久，千里共婵娟”的期愿。而今，人们听着嫦娥奔月的神话合家赏月，传承着中华民族永恒的情感。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt" align=right><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>                                                  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>(8)</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">班</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">谭跃洲</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学借此佳节之际，纷纷向家人表达了自己的心意。无论是一张贺卡，一句祝福，或是一道亲手做的菜，都体现出同学们对亲人浓浓的爱——只言片语总关情啊！</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">下面，是两篇高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班同学在中秋节之后的感受。字里行间，都洋溢着我一中人的积极奋发。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）班的同学们精心制作了电子海报，传递中秋问候。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>       </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">片片情意暖人心，一中各个团支部的同学们都在中秋假期里开展了丰富的活动，度过了一个难忘而有意义的活动，展现出了一中学子的风采与气质。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
